/S /H1
/P 87 0 R
/T (The proposed AI Malicious URL Detector utilizes machine learning algorithms to classify URLs based on their extracted features and provide real-time predictions. This intelligent approach improves detection accuracy, reduces dependence on manually updated blacklists, minimizes false positives, and enhances the overall security of internet users. The system aims to provide a reliable, efficient, and scalable solution that helps individuals and organizations protect themselves from phishing attacks, malware distribution, and other web-based cyber threats, thereby contributing to a safer digital environment. )
/E (The proposed AI Malicious URL Detector utilizes machine learning algorithms to classify URLs based on their extracted features and provide real-time predictions. This intelligent approach improves detection accuracy, reduces dependence on manually updated blacklists, minimizes false positives, and enhances the overall security of internet users. The system aims to provide a reliable, efficient, and scalable solution that helps individuals and organizations protect themselves from phishing attacks, malware distribution, and other web-based cyber threats, thereby contributing to a safer digital environment. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
