/T (The AI Malicious URL Detector is an intelligent web security system designed to identify and classify malicious URLs using Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) and Machine Learning \(ML\) techniques. The primary purpose of the system is to protect users from phishing attacks, malware distribution, and other cyber threats by analyzing URLs before they are accessed.)
/E (The AI Malicious URL Detector is an intelligent web security system designed to identify and classify malicious URLs using Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) and Machine Learning \(ML\) techniques. The primary purpose of the system is to protect users from phishing attacks, malware distribution, and other cyber threats by analyzing URLs before they are accessed.)
