/P 91 0 R
/T (The rapid growth of internet usage has led to a significant increase in the number of phishing websites worldwide. Cybercriminals continuously create fake websites that imitate trusted organizations, including banks, online shopping platforms, government portals, and social media services. Millions of such phishing websites are generated every year with the objective of deceiving users into revealing confidential information.)
/E (The rapid growth of internet usage has led to a significant increase in the number of phishing websites worldwide. Cybercriminals continuously create fake websites that imitate trusted organizations, including banks, online shopping platforms, government portals, and social media services. Millions of such phishing websites are generated every year with the objective of deceiving users into revealing confidential information.)
