/T (Phishing websites are one of the leading causes of financial fraud. Attackers often design fake banking or payment gateway websites that closely resemble legitimate ones. When users unknowingly enter their banking credentials, credit card details, or one-time passwords \(OTPs\), the stolen information is used to perform unauthorized financial transactions, resulting in substantial monetary losses.)
/E (Phishing websites are one of the leading causes of financial fraud. Attackers often design fake banking or payment gateway websites that closely resemble legitimate ones. When users unknowingly enter their banking credentials, credit card details, or one-time passwords \(OTPs\), the stolen information is used to perform unauthorized financial transactions, resulting in substantial monetary losses.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
