/E (Another major consequence of phishing attacks is identity theft. Personal information such as usernames, passwords, email addresses, mobile numbers, and other sensitive data can be stolen and misused for illegal activities. Stolen identities may be used to access personal accounts, commit fraud, or conduct further cyberattacks.)
