/E (Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) and Machine Learning \(ML\) have emerged as effective technologies for detecting malicious URLs and overcoming the limitations of traditional blacklist-based detection methods. Unlike conventional systems that rely only on previously identified malicious websites, AI-based models learn patterns and characteristics from large datasets containing both legitimate and malicious URLs.)
