/E (During the training process, the machine learning model analyzes various URL features such as URL length, domain structure, special characters, subdomains, HTTPS usage, and other lexical attributes. By learning these patterns, the model can recognize similarities between known malicious URLs and newly encountered URLs, even if they have never been seen before.)
