/Title (The combination of these technologies provides a complete development environment for building an AI-powered malicious URL detection system. Python and machine learning libraries enable efficient model development, while web technologies provide users with an accessible platform for real-time URL analysis.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 368 0 R
/Prev 861 0 R
>>
endobj
636 0 obj
<<
/Title (The integration of AI improves the accuracy and efficiency of malicious URL detection by enabling the system to learn from existing datasets and identify hidden patterns associated with cyber threats. Unlike conventional approaches, the proposed system can detect suspicious and previously unseen URLs by analyzing various URL features such as structure, length, domain characteristics, and other relevant attributes.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 31 0 R
/Prev 369 0 R
/Next 862 0 R
>>
endobj
637 0 obj
<<
/Title (In conclusion, the AI Malicious URL Detector contributes to creating a safer internet environment by providing an intelligent, reliable, and scalable approach to identifying malicious URLs. By combining artificial intelligence with cybersecurity practices, the system helps improve online safety, protects users from evolving cyber threats, and supports the development of more secure digital platforms.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 31 0 R
/Prev 863 0 R
/Next 370 0 R
>>
