/Title (The AI Malicious URL Detector follows a modular architecture designed to provide fast and accurate URL classification. The system begins when a user enters a URL through the web interface. The input URL is sent to the backend, where it undergoes preprocessing and feature extraction. Important lexical and structural features such as URL length, presence of special characters, number of subdomains, HTTPS usage, and domain-related information are extracted.)
