/Title (The primary aim of this project is to develop an AI-based Malicious URL Detection System capable of accurately identifying whether a given URL is safe or malicious. With the rapid growth of internet usage and the increasing number of phishing attacks, fraudulent websites, and malware distribution, there is a growing need for an intelligent system that can detect harmful URLs before users access them.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 943 0 R
/Next 1071 0 R
>>
endobj
1026 0 obj
<<
/Title (Furthermore, the system aims to provide a fast, reliable, and user-friendly solution that can assist individuals and organizations in protecting sensitive information from phishing attacks, malware infections, and other cyber threats. By integrating artificial intelligence into cybersecurity, the project contributes to creating a safer and more secure online browsing environment.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 943 0 R
/Prev 1072 0 R
>>
endobj
1027 0 obj
<<
/Title (2. INTRODUCTION)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
