1028 0 obj
<<
/Title (Classification Process:)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1076 0 R
/Next 944 0 R
>>
endobj
1029 0 obj
<<
/Title (The extracted features are then provided to the trained Machine Learning model, which analyzes the URL and predicts whether it is Safe or Malicious. The prediction result, along with the confidence score, is returned to the user through the web application. The system also stores the URL, prediction, and timestamp in the database for future analysis and reporting.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 857 0 R
/Prev 945 0 R
/Next 946 0 R
>>
endobj
