1183 0 obj
<<
/Title (All submitted URLs are handled securely during analysis. The system processes only the URL required for classification and does not retain unnecessary user data. Appropriate security measures are followed to prevent misuse of collected information and to ensure the confidentiality and integrity of the detection process.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1165 0 R
/Prev 1177 0 R
/Next 1178 0 R
>>
endobj
1184 0 obj
<<
/Title (Unlike traditional blacklist-based detection methods, the proposed solution does not depend solely on previously known malicious websites. Instead, it learns patterns from a large dataset of legitimate and malicious URLs and uses these learned patterns to identify both known and previously unseen malicious URLs.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1174 0 R
/Prev 1179 0 R
/Next 1190 0 R
>>
endobj
1185 0 obj
<<
