/Title (For this project, a dataset containing both legitimate \(safe\) URLs and malicious URLs will be collected from reliable cybersecurity sources and publicly available repositories. The dataset will include examples of normal websites as well as URLs associated with phishing attacks, malware distribution, and other suspicious activities. The collected dataset will be divided into two major categories:)
