1194 0 obj
<<
/Title (Feature extraction is a crucial step in the development of the AI Malicious URL Detector, as it converts raw URL data into meaningful attributes that can be analyzed by the machine learning model. Since malicious and legitimate websites often have different structural and behavioral patterns, extracting relevant features helps the AI model identify these differences and improve classification accuracy.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1188 0 R
/Next 1201 0 R
>>
endobj
